          "content": {
            "en": "Introduction Arkonsult Engineering Consultants is a multi-disciplinary design and Engineering Consultancy Firm providing services for most types of building projects. We specialize in the fields of Architecture, Structural, MEP, Sustainable Design and Civil Engineering",
